0..42 Comment "//! Two renamings compose to one renaming."
43..46 Comment "//!"
47..105 Comment "//! The pointwise lookup hypothesis proves the composition"
106..207 Comment "//! [Allais-2021-a_type_and_scope_safe_universe_of_syntaxes_with_binding_their_semantics_and_proofs]."
208..211 Comment "//!"
212..290 Comment "//! An induction on a term proves each composition. The hypothesis lifts under"
291..359 Comment "//! an abstraction. An application joins two paths with `Path.walk`."
360..363 Comment "//!"
364..473 Comment "//! - cites: [Allais-2021-a_type_and_scope_safe_universe_of_syntaxes_with_binding_their_semantics_and_proofs]"
